size-1592751.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IShowSpeed surpasses 49 million subscribers during his Africa tour as his viral fame continues to grow]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126627631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[YouTuber IShowSpeed has surpassed 49 million subscribers during his Africa tour, livestreaming from Algiers. His raw, energetic broadcasts, featuring gaming, travel, and real-life interactions, have captivated a global audience.  The tour, visiting countries like Kenya and Algeria, has significantly boosted his popularity, demonstrating the power of live streaming and authentic fan connection.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-surpasses-49-million-subscribers-during-his-africa-tour-as-his-viral-fame-continues-to-grow/articleshow/126627631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-surpasses-49-million-subscribers-during-his-africa-tour-as-his-viral-fame-continues-to-grow/articleshow/126627631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-18T01:28:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126627611,imgsize-833971.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Five 'Patels' steal microwave, coffee machine from Canada gas station store, arrested and released]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126626617.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/five-patels-steal-microwave-coffee-machine-from-canada-gas-station-store-arrested-and-released/articleshow/126626617.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/five-patels-steal-microwave-coffee-machine-from-canada-gas-station-store-arrested-and-released/articleshow/126626617.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-18T00:51:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126626785,imgsize-21692.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘It’s time to look for new leadership’: Trump calls for change in Iran’s regime — is the president renewing threats against Tehran?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126623652.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Trump called for new leadership in Iran, urging an end to Ayatollah Ali Khamenei's 37-year rule. This statement followed widespread protests and deadly crackdowns, with Trump previously threatening intervention. Khamenei responded by accusing Trump of responsibility for violence, while Trump countered that Iran's leadership relies on repression and violence to govern.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/its-time-to-look-for-new-leadership-trump-calls-for-end-of-sick-khameneis-regime-is-the-president-renewing-threats-against-iran/articleshow/126623652.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/its-time-to-look-for-new-leadership-trump-calls-for-end-of-sick-khameneis-regime-is-the-president-renewing-threats-against-iran/articleshow/126623652.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T23:35:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126624074,imgsize-44420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Applied for H-1B eight times, never selected in lottery': NRI man says he's trying to move back to India]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;marg