eg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126622304,imgsize-51494.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Don't take up part-time jobs': Fresh warning on social media amid reports of ICE detaining two Indians from a Minnesota restaurant]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126622012.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dont-take-up-part-time-jobs-fresh-warning-on-social-media-amid-reports-of-ice-detaining-two-indians-from-a-minnesota-restaurant/articleshow/126622012.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dont-take-up-part-time-jobs-fresh-warning-on-social-media-amid-reports-of-ice-detaining-two-indians-from-a-minnesota-restaurant/articleshow/126622012.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T22:34:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126622133,imgsize-566726.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘This is one of the seven days’: ICE agent’s reply in exchange with Somali man sparks viral reaction — video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126620622.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A viral video captures a heated confrontation between a Somali man and an ICE agent. The man vehemently denied collecting welfare, claiming to work seven days a week. The agent's sharp retort, pointing out the man wasn't at work that day, has been widely praised online, with many calling it a "legendary" comeback.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-one-of-the-seven-days-ice-agents-reply-in-exchange-with-somali-man-sparks-viral-reaction-video/articleshow/126620622.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-one-of-the-seven-days-ice-agents-reply-in-exchange-with-somali-man-sparks-viral-reaction-video/articleshow/126620622.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T22:25:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126621762,imgsize-29876.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US had months of quiet talks with Venezuela’s Diosdado Cabello before and after Maduro raid — is Delcy Rodriguez’s position at risk?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126619610.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Venezuela's interim President Delcy Rodriguez is consolidating power after Maduro's seizure, appointing loyalists and seeking US backing. However, she faces a significant internal threat from Interior Minister Diosdado Cabello, who has close ties to security forces and motorcycle gangs. Rodriguez navigates this delicate balance while addressing economic instability and internal dissent.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-had-months-of-quiet-talks-with-venezuelas-diosdado-cabello-before-and-after-maduro-raid-is-delcy-rodriguezs-position-at-risk/articleshow/126619610.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-had-months-of-quiet-talks-with-venezuelas-diosdado-cabello-before-and-after-maduro-raid-is-delcy-rodriguezs-position-at-risk/articleshow/126619610.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T22:02:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126620454,imgsize-34582.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NYC heist: Gunmen take 'gotta catch ’em all' too seriously; Pokémon cards worth $100k stolen]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126620441.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Armed robbers stormed a Manhattan Pokémon card shop, making off with rare collectibles worth over $100,000. The brazen heist, which lasted only three minutes, saw thieves smash a display case and grab high-value cards, including a first-edition Charizard. This incident highlights a growing trend of Pokémon card thefts across the US, driven by their increasing value as investments.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-heist-gunmen-take-gotta-catch-em-all-too-seriously-pokmon-cards-worth-100000-stolen/articleshow/126620441.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-york-heist-gunmen-take-gotta-catch-em-all-too-seriously-pokmon-cards-worth-100000-stolen/articleshow/126620441.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T21:41:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126620641,imgsize-67406.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin doctor arrested in Ohio after 10-week-old infant son found with broken bones: 'Don't know how this happened']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126620442.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-doctor-arrested-in-ohio-after-10-week-old-infant-son-found-with-broken-bones-dont-know-how-this-happened/articleshow/126620442.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-doctor-arrested-in-ohio-after-10-week-old-infant-son-found-with-broken-bones-dont-know-how-this-happened/articleshow/126620442.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T21:36:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126620514,imgsize-352131.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canada cosies up to China: Mark Carney strikes key deals with Xi Jinping; why Donald Trump will be furious]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126617252.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Canada's Prime Minister Mark Carney has forged a significant trade deal with China, lowering tariffs on canola oil and electric vehicles. This landmark agreement signals a thawing of diplomatic ties after years of strain and aims to diversify Canada's trade away from the United States, a move potentially influenced by recent US trade uncertainties.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-cosies-up-to-china-mark-carney-strikes-key-deals-with-xi-jinping-why-donald-trump-will-be-furious/articleshow/126617252.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-cosies-up-to-china-mark-carney-strikes-key-deals-with-xi-jinping-why-donald-trump-will-be-furious/articleshow/126617252.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T20:47:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126619118,imgsize-46282.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Communication lost': Indonesian aircraft with 10 on board goes missing; search under way]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126618895.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Indonesian authorities are conducting an extensive search for a turboprop aircraft that lost contact en route from Yogyakarta to Makassar. The plane was carrying three government employees from the Ministry of Marine Affairs and Fisheries and seven crew members. Search teams, including aerial assets and ground crews, are focusing on a mountainous area near the plane's last known location.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/communication-lost-indonesian-aircraft-with-10-on-board-goes-missing-search-under-way/articleshow/126618895.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/communication-lost-indonesian-aircraft-with-10-on-board-goes-missing-search-under-way/articleshow/126618895.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-17T20:44:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126619061,imgsize-208985.cms"/></item></channel></rss>